 rAtOP"><a href="/about" class="sc-eDPEul XnCuK">About</a></li><li href="https://github.com/spotify/basic-pitch" class="sc-dLMFU rAtOP"><a target="_new" href="https://github.com/spotify/basic-pitch" class="sc-eDPEul XnCuK">Github</a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sc-jXbUNg kkWygo"><div class="sc-dhKdcB kFdTCZ"><div class="sc-fBWQRz hMppqn"><p class="Type__TypeElement-goli3j-0 HrreC sc-fUnMCh sc-bmzYkS fzvzMF duhLqi">Try Basic Pitch, a free audio-to-MIDI converter with pitch bend detection, built by Spotify.<!-- --> <a target="_self" href="/about" class="Link-k8gsk-0 fdGTwW sc-hzhJZQ lkqHdT">Learn more</a> <!-- -->or follow the instructions below.</p><ul class="Type__TypeElement-goli3j-0 HrreC sc-fUnMCh sc-koXPp fzvzMF iiOlPm"><li>Press record and sing a ditty into your computer. Or drop a recording of any single instrument (piano, guitar, xylophone, you name it).</li><li>Then get a MIDI version back. Just like that.</li><li>Download the MIDI file to fine tune and make corrections in your favorite digital audio workstation.</li></ul></div><div class="sc-hknOHE kQBXzx"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="sc-eBMEME jAxcPV"><input type="file" accept="audio/*" style="display:none" tabindex="-1"/><p class="Type__TypeElement-goli3j-0 djmEZE sc-fUnMCh sc-bmzYkS fzvzMF tmqqB">Drop your audio file here or click to select one (.wav, .mp3, etc.)</p></div><button class="Button-qlcn5g-0 jQhgVt"><div class="ButtonInner-sc-14ud5tc-0 vodBW encore-bright-accent-set sc-ikkxIA sc-feUZmu dWJlFY bGDTpF"><span aria-hidden="true" class="IconWrapper__Wrapper-sc-1hf1hjl-0 gzFdXs"><svg role="img" height="24" width="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="Svg-sc-1bi12j5-0 eBJXLE"><path d='M7 5a5 5 0 0110 0v6a5 5 0 01-10 0V5zm5-3a3 3 0 00-3 3v6a3 3 0 106 0V5a3 3 0 00-3-3z'/><path d='M3 7a1 1 0 011 1v3a8 8 0 1016 0V8a1 1 0 112 0v3c0 5.185-3.947 9.449-9 9.95V24h-2v-3.05c-5.053-.5-9-4.764-9-9.95V8a1 1 0 011-1z'/></svg></span>Record</div><div class="ButtonFocus-sc-2hq6ey-0 gslBRu"></div>